#: ../../../explanation/comparisons.rst:67
msgid ""
"``PIPX_BIN_DIR`` and ``UV_TOOL_BIN_DIR`` both default to ``~/.local/bin`` on "
"Unix, so installing the same tool with both managers writes the same "
"filename. Each manager refuses to overwrite a binary the other one wrote "
"without ``--force``. Use ``pipx install --suffix=...`` to keep two copies "
"side-by-side; ``uv`` has no equivalent."
msgstr ""

